{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱元揆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謝詞\n不錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "門弟子海印　成名　成心，領南嶽方廣\n　眾弟子，同刻第一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱元揆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘玉可　心禪　偉如　咸潤　戒弟\n　子成潔　自度　子祥　佛頂　同捐刻\n　第二卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱元揆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "冬至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "門弟子明秀　成曠　同捐刻第三卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱元揆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "門弟子成林\n　領刻弟四卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱元揆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "門弟子成蓮　戒弟子時照　慧明\n　　　　祖月　麗天\n　　　　成楷等捐貲刻第五卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱元揆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "門弟子真印\n　　　　　　　　領刻第六卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱元揆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "咦！"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戒弟子克真　洪輝　惺覺　悉微\n　　　　登微　清塵　仁足　穎標\n　　　　雪蘆　恒修　潤潔　同刻\n　　　　第七卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱元揆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "密雲悟和尚　弘覺忞和尚　遠菴僼和尚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昱堂長老請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "洞野先監院請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "月濤粲維那請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弘宗誓書記請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "永隆先長老請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "等菴定長老請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昂韜俊監院請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子沈君弘請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本山眾請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慧鋒鎧維那請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道權法維那請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "節菴祿書記請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "修木林書記請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玉燈昇知藏請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "覺乘印知藏請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昱林知知藏請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非石琇知藏請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗朗心知藏請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隱中顯書記請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六標蓮侍者請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "險崖惺侍者請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "簡文印書記請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鑒融宗知藏請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道開蓮知藏請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "素即知客請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法侄成英　成旻　成智　侄孫佛衣\n　　　佛雯　戒弟子奇明　拙浪　越三\n　信士鄭維周室蕭氏　蔣茂修室王氏\n　　　劉通也室王氏　比丘尼惟修等，同\n　　　刻第八卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱元揆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "塔在溪上菴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "朕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "底向"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "門弟子定祿　性蓮捐刻第九卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱元揆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "原韻竹林前一株挺秀，名尊者，詠之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "易歇華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陳維垣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "福田居士涂雲芳　門弟子成品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱元揆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱先固"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即彼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "門弟子成俊、　成、　成崑同刻第十一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱元揆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四眾弟子等各捐刊貲刻此\n　本師　揆和尚語錄全部一十二卷，人于\n　　大藏流通。伏願法輪常轉，共證無生。\n　康熙三十八年己卯菊月望日謹識。"}
